-0aec2f2632ab"))(global_label "GND" (shape bidirectional) (at 180.34 196.85 0) (effects (font (size 0.85 0.85)) (justify left)) (uuid "9fcffc68-4f6d-5091-bb0d-b8db5482d4a8"))(text "J1: MEC1-110-02-L-D-NP-A, all 20 contacts populated. NP version requires external orientation key and retention.\nU12 isolates NVM. U13/U14 isolate all sensor signals as one group. Unused sensor interfaces must stay high-Z.\nAll daughter-facing pull-ups reference VDD_DAUGHTER; MCU internal pull-ups must be off before isolation.\nNVM_WP and SENSOR_RESET_N are open-drain host controls. IRQ_N is open-drain from daughter.\nHost I2C pull-ups are 4.7k. IR daughter optional pull-ups remain DNP. Qualify capacitance and rise time.\nTPD2E2U06 arrays protect connector signals. Stuck-bus recovery is firmware; system ESD still needs testing." (at 12 220.9 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9cafdd61-1659-5ab2-a74e-dd036560c865")))
